Third-party palette inspiration
-------------------------------

Several skin names refer to well-known public color schemes. Those schemes are
used only as an aesthetic reference. No palette files, code, fonts, or other
assets are copied from these projects; the color values in this package were
selected independently for this plugin.

- Nord: Arctic Ice Studio and Sven Greb, https://www.nordtheme.com, MIT License.
- Tokyo Night: enkia, https://github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme, MIT License.
- Solarized: Ethan Schoonover, https://ethanschoonover.com/solarized, MIT License.
- Codex Terminal: an original interpretation of a classic command-line look.
  This package is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by OpenAI.

All other code and assets in this package are original work by the
dsh-terminal-mode contributors.
